            "title": "港股開跌359點   網易瀉逾13%  模型股挫逾8%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股恒生指數開跌359點或1.57%，報22,482點 ; 恒生科技指數開跌1107點或2.95%，報3,541，恒生國企指數報7,568，跌122點或1.59%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">大市成交31.38億元。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"網易 (Shutterstock圖片)\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20230823_FI_source_licensed_09999-2_shutterstock_.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"網易 (Shutterstock圖片)\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2024/05/20230823_FI_source_licensed_09999-2_shutterstock_.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">網易 (Shutterstock圖片)</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">網易(09999)大挫13.27%，報162.1元，成交入20大。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">阿里巴巴(09988)升0.93%，報81.3元 ; 騰訊(00700)跌2.12%，報341元，成交居首。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">智譜(02513)跌8.56%，報329元; MINIMAX(00100)也跌8.54%，報105元。]</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">友邦(01299)挫2.98%，報73.3元 ; 滙控(00005)跌2.18%，報130.4元。</p>\n</div>",
